hadiths[72]{hadithnumber,text}:
"6983","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ye ibne Adam hai aur ye us ki ajal hai, aur phir us ki ummeed hai, aur phir us ki ummeed hai, aur phir us ki ummeed hai."
"6984","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ye ummeed hai aur ye ajal hai; pas jab wo isi haalat mein hota hai ke us ke paas qareeb ki lakeer aa jati hai."
"6985","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ye insan hai aur ye us ki ajal hai jo usay gher leti hai, aur ye jo us ki ummeed se bahar hai, aur ye chhoti lakeerein aaraz hain; pas agar ye chook gaya to wo use das deta hai, aur agar ye chook gaya to wo use das deta hai."
"6986","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ye kaddoo hai jisse hum apna khana zyada karte hain."
"6987","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ye wo hai jis ke liye arsh hil gaya, aasman ke darwaze khul gaye aur sattar hazaar farishton ne us ki shahadat di; us ne ek dabaav diya phir us se chhutkara diya gaya."
"6988","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ye waqoof ki jagah hai aur Arfa pura waqoof ki jagah hai."
"6989","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ye wuzu hai; pas jis ne is se zyada kiya us ne bura kiya, hadd se badha aur zulm kiya."
"6990","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ye waqt hai ke logon se ilm chheen liya jayega yahan tak ke wo us se kuch na kar sakenge. Ae Ziyad, teri maa ka gham! Main tujhe Madina ke fuqaha mein ginta tha; ye Taurat aur Injil yahudiyon aur nasraniyon ke paas hain, to un ke kya kaam aaye?!"
"6991","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ye Jibreel hain, apne ghore ka sar pakde hue, un par jang ka hathiyar hai."
"6992","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ye aisa pahar hai jo hum se muhabbat karta hai aur hum us se muhabbat karte hain."
"6993","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ye ek patthar hai jo sattar saal se aag mein phenka gaya hai, wo abhi aag mein gir raha hai jab wo us ki tah tak pahuncha hai."
"6994","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ye mere maa ke bhai hain; pas har aadmi apne maa ke bhai ko dekhe."
"6995","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ye Ramzan ka maheena tumhare paas aa gaya jis mein jannat ke darwaze khol diye jate hain, aag ke darwaze band kar diye jate hain aur shaitanon ko zanjeeron mein band kar diya jata hai."
"6996","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ye Qazah hai aur ye waqoof ki jagah hai, aur Muzdalifa pura waqoof ki jagah hai; aur main ne yahan zibah kiya aur Mina pura zibah ki jagah hai; pas apni jagahon par zibah karo."
"6997","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ye Qazah hai aur ye waqoof ki jagah hai, Muzdalifa pura waqoof ki jagah hai; ye zibah ki jagah hai aur Mina pura zibah ki jagah hai."
"6998","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ye us mein se hai jis ne apna ahad poora kar diya; yani Talha."
"6999","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ye mujh se hai, yani Hasan, aur Husain Ali se hai."
"7000","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ye tehband ki jagah hai; pas agar tum inkar karo to us se neeche, aur agar phir inkar karo to takhnon ka tehband mein koi haq nahi."
"7001","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ye us naimat mein se hai jis ke baare mein tum se poocha jayega, us zaat ki qasam jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai: thandi chhaon, taza khajoor aur thanda pani."
"7002","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ye Ashura ka din hai aur Allah ne tum par is ka roza farz nahi kiya; aur main roze se hun; pas jo chahe roza rakhe aur jo chahe iftar kare."
"7003","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ye mere do bete hain aur meri beti ke do bete; Ae Allah, main un se muhabbat karta hun, pas tu un se muhabbat kar aur un se muhabbat karne walon se muhabbat kar."
"7004","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ye do sunne aur dekhne ki tarah hain; yani Abu Bakr aur Umar."
"7005","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ye do ahl-e-jannat ke boodhon ke sardar hain, awwalin aur aakhirin mein se, siwaye nabi aur rasool ke; Ae Ali, inhein mat batao; yani Abu Bakr aur Umar."
"7006","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ye aag jahannam ke sau hisson mein se ek hissa hai."
"7007","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ye us pehle daura ke badle hai."
"7008","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ye Hajj, aur is ke baad chataiyon ki pushton par rehna; aap ne ye Hajjat-ul-Wida mein apni biwiyon se farmaya."
"7009","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ye rehmat hai jo Allah apne bandon mein se jise chahe us ke dilon mein rakhta hai; aur Allah apne bandon mein se sirf reham karne walon par reham karta hai."
"7010","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ye gharon ki namaz hai; yani maghrib ke baad ki nafil."
"7011","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ye Tayba hai aur ye Uhud hai, aur wo aisa pahar hai jo hum se muhabbat karta hai aur hum us se muhabbat karte hain."
"7012","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ye Arfa hai aur ye waqoof ki jagah hai, aur Arfa pura waqoof ki jagah hai."
"7013","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ye Umrah hai jis se hum ne tamattu kiya; pas jis ke paas hadi na ho wo pura ihram khol de, kyunke Umrah Hajj mein dakhil ho gaya qayamat tak."
"7014","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ye aur ye barabar hain; yani chhoti ungli aur angoothta."
"7015","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Is tarah wuzu hai; pas jis ne is se zyada kiya.... us ne bura kiya aur zulm kiya."
"7016","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Is tarah, kyunke ijazat lena dekhne hi ki wajah se hai."
"7017","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kya yahan banu fulan mein se koi hai? Tumhara saathi apne qarz mein qaid hai."
"7018","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Yahan fitnon ki zameen hai jahan se Shaitan ka seengh nikalta hai."
"7019","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hassan ne un ki hija ki aur us ne apna dil thanda kiya."
"7020","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Musalman ka apne bhai se juda hona goya us ka khoon bahana hai."
"7021","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aamilon ke tohfe ghulul hain."
"7022","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mutah ko nikah, talaq, iddat aur miras ne mansookh kar diya."
"7023","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kya tu ek ungli hi nahi jise khoon laga, aur Allah ki raah mein jo kuch tum par guzra."
"7024","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kya tum mere ameeron ko chhod doge? Tumhare liye un ke maamle ka saaf hissa hai aur un par us ka gadla pan."
"7025","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kya tum mere ameeron ko chhod doge? Tumhari aur un ki misal us aadmi ki tarah hai jis ne oont ya bakriyan charane ko di, phir unhein charaya, phir un ke pane ka waqt aaya to unhein hauz par laaya, wo us mein utar kar saaf pani pi gayin aur gadla chhod gayin; pas saaf pani tumhare liye hai aur gadla un par."
"7026","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kya tum jante ho ye sooraj kahan ghurub hota hai? Wo garam chashme mein ghurub hota hai."
"7027","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kya tum jante ho Kausar kya hai? Wo ek nehar hai jo mere Rab ne mujhe jannat mein ata kiya, us par bahut khair hai; qayamat ke din meri ummat us par aayegi, us ke bartan sitaraon ki ginti ke barabar honge; kisi bande ko un se kheencha jayega to main kahunga: Ae mere Rab, wo meri ummat se hai; to kaha jayega: Tum nahi jante ke us ne tumhare baad kya naya kiya."
"7028","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kya tum jante ho tumhare Rab ne aaj raat kya kaha? Allah ne farmaya: Mere bandon mein se kuch momin aur kuch kafir hue; pas jis ne kaha ke hum par Allah ke fazl aur rehmat se barish hui wo momin hai aur sitaraon ka munkir hai; aur jis ne kaha ke hum par falan sitare ke sabab barish hui wo mujh se kafir hai aur sitare par momin hai."
"7029","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kya tum meri qibla yahan samajhte ho? Allah ki qasam, tumhari khushu aur ruku mujh par chhupi nahi; main tumhein apni peeth ke peechhe se dekhta hun."
"7030","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kya tum woh nahi dekhte jo main dekhta hun? Main fitnon ke maqam tumhare gharon ke darmiyan aise dekhta hun jaise baarish ke qatre."
"7031","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kya tum dopahar ke waqt saaf aasman mein sooraj dekhne mein kisi shak mein hote ho jab us ke saath koi baadal na ho? Aur kya tum poore chaand ki raat mein saaf aasman mein chaand dekhne mein shak karte ho jab us mein koi baadal na ho? Tum qayamat ke din Allah ke deedar mein utna hi shak nahi karoge jitna in donon mein se kisi ek ke deedar mein nahi karte. Jab qayamat ka din hoga to ek pukarnewala pukarega: Har ummat apne us mabood ke peechhe chale jis ki wo ibadat karti thi. Pas Allah ke siwa jin buton aur pattharon ki ibadat ki jati thi, un ke ibadat karne wale sab aag mein girte chale jayenge, yahan tak ke sirf wo log baqi rahenge jo Allah ki ibadat karte the, nek ho ya fajir, aur ahl-e-kitab ke siwaye. Phir yahudiyon ko bulaya jayega aur kaha jayega: Tum kis ki ibadat karte the? Wo kahenge: Hum Uzair bin Allah ki ibadat karte the. Kaha jayega: Tum ne jhoot kaha, Allah ne na koi biwi banai na koi beta; to tum kya chahte ho? Wo kahenge: Ae hamare Rab, humein pyas lagi hai, pas humein pilao. Un ki taraf ishara kiya jayega: Kya tum wapas nahi jaate? Pas wo aag ki taraf hashr kiye jayenge, goya wo sarab hai jo ek doosre ko tod raha hai, aur wo aag mein girte jayenge. Phir nasraniyon ko bulaya jayega aur kaha jayega: Tum kis ki ibadat karte the? Wo kahenge: Hum Masih bin Allah ki ibadat karte the. Un se kaha jayega: Tum ne jhoot kaha, Allah ne na koi biwi banai na koi beta; to tum kya chahte ho? Wo kahenge: Ae hamare Rab, humein pyas lagi hai, pas humein pilao. Un ki taraf ishara kiya jayega: Kya tum wapas nahi jaate? Pas wo jahannam ki taraf hashr kiye jayenge, goya wo sarab hai jo ek doosre ko tod raha hai, aur wo aag mein girte jayenge, yahan tak ke sirf wo log baqi rahenge jo Allah ki ibadat karte the, nek ho ya fajir. Phir un ke paas Rabbul Aalamin aayega us soorat mein jo unhon ne dekhi thi us se kamtar soorat mein aur farmayega: Tum kis ka intezar karte ho? Har ummat apne mabood ke peechhe chali gayi. Wo kahenge: Ae hamare Rab, duniya mein log hum se alag ho gaye jab hum un ke sab se zyada mohtaj the, aur hum ne un ki sohbat ikhtiyar nahi ki. Wo farmayega: Main tumhara Rab hun. Wo kahenge: Hum Allah ki panah maangte hain tujh se, hum Allah ke saath kisi ko sharik nahi thehrate, do ya teen martaba, yahan tak ke un mein se kuch palatne ke qareeb ho jayenge. Wo farmayega: Kya tumhare aur us ke darmiyan koi nishani hai jis se tum use pehchano? Wo kahenge: Haan, pindli. Pas pindli kholegi, phir jo bhi apni marzi se Allah ke liye sajda karta tha Allah use sajde ki ijazat dega, aur jo darr ya dikhawe ke liye sajda karta tha Allah us ki peeth ek hi teh kar dega; jab bhi wo sajda karna chahega apni gardan ke bal gir jayega. Phir wo apne sar uthayenge aur wo us soorat mein badal chuka hoga jis mein unhon ne pehli baar dekha tha; wo farmayega: Main tumhara Rab hun; wo kahenge: Tu hi hamara Rab hai. Phir jahannam par pul banaya jayega aur shafaat halal ho jayegi aur wo kahenge: Ae Allah, salaamat de, salaamat de. Arz kiya gaya: Ae Allah ke Rasool, pul kya hai? Aap ne farmaya: Wo phisalne wali jagah hai, us mein kaante aur baanki hain, aur Najd mein ek kanta hota hai jise Saadan kaha jata hai. Pas momin us par aankh ki palak ki tarah, bijli ki tarah, hawa ki tarah, parinde ki tarah aur tez ghoron aur sawariyon ki tarah guzarenge; koi bachne wala salaamat bachega, koi zakhm khakar chhut jayega, aur koi jahannam ki aag mein dhakel diya jayega. Yahan tak ke jab momin aag se nikal jayenge, to us zaat ki qasam jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai, qayamat ke din momin apne un bhaiyon ke liye jo aag mein honge Allah se haq poora karne ki jo sakht iltija karenge wo tum mein se kisi ki iltija se badh kar hogi. Wo kahenge: Ae hamare Rab, ye log hamare saath roze rakhte the, namaz padhte the aur Hajj karte the. Un se kaha jayega: Jinhein tum pehchante ho unhein nikaal do; pas un ki sooraten aag par haram kar di jayengi. Wo bahut si makhlooq ko nikaalenge jinhein aag ne aadhi pindli aur ghutnon tak pakad liya hoga. Wo kahenge: Ae hamare Rab, jis ka tu ne humein hukum diya tha un mein se koi baqi nahi. Allah azz wa jal farmayega: Wapas jao, pas jis ke dil mein ek dinar ke barabar khair pao use nikaal lo. Wo bahut si makhlooq ko nikaalenge, phir kahenge: Ae hamare Rab, hum ne un mein se kisi ko baqi nahi chhoda jis ka tu ne hukum diya tha. Phir wo farmayega: Wapas jao, jis ke dil mein aadhe dinar ke barabar khair pao use nikaal lo. Wo bahut si makhlooq ko nikaalenge, phir kahenge: Ae hamare Rab, hum ne un mein se kisi ko baqi nahi chhoda jis ka tu ne hukum diya tha. Phir wo farmayega: Wapas jao, jis ke dil mein zarra ke barabar khair pao use nikaal lo. Wo bahut si makhlooq ko nikaalenge, phir kahenge: Ae hamare Rab, hum ne us mein koi khair baqi nahi chhodi. Phir Allah farmayega: Farishton ne shafaat ki, nabiyon ne shafaat ki, mominon ne shafaat ki, aur ab sirf Arhamur-Rahimeen baqi hai. Pas wo aag se ek mutthi pakadta hai aur us se aise log nikaalta hai jinhon ne kabhi koi khair nahi ki, wo koyla ban chuke honge. Unhein jannat ke muhane par ek nehar mein daalta hai jise Nehar-e-Hayat kaha jata hai. Wo aise ugte hain jaise sail ke kachre mein daana ugta hai. Kya tum nahi dekhte ke wo patthar ya darakht ki taraf hota hai, sooraj ki taraf jo hota hai wo zard aur hara hota hai, aur chhaon ki taraf jo hota hai wo safed hota hai. Wo moti ki tarah nikalenge, un ki gardanon mein moharein hongi; jannat wale unhein pehchan lenge: Ye Allah ke azad kiye hue hain aag se, jinhein Allah ne jannat mein dakhil kiya baghair kisi amal ke jo unhon ne kiya ho ya kisi khair ke jo unhon ne aage bheja ho. Phir farmayega: Jannat mein dakhil ho jao, jo kuch tum ne dekha wo tumhara hai. Wo kahenge: Ae hamare Rab, tu ne humein wo diya jo aalamin mein se kisi ko nahi diya. Farmayega: Tumhare liye mere paas is se behtar hai. Wo kahenge: Ae hamare Rab, is se behtar kya cheez hai? Farmayega: Meri razamandi, pas us ke baad main tum par kabhi ghazabnaak nahi hunga."
"7032","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kya tum dopahar ke waqt sooraj dekhne mein jhagda karte ho jab wo baadal mein na ho? Kya tum poore chaand ki raat chaand dekhne mein jhagda karte ho jab wo baadal mein na ho? Us zaat ki qasam jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai, tum apne Rab azz wa jal ke deedar mein utna hi jhagda nahi karoge jitna in donon mein se kisi ek ke deedar mein nahi karte. Phir ek banda laya jayega aur us se kaha jayega: Ae falan, kya main ne tumhein izzat nahi di, tumhein sardar nahi banaya, tumhari shadi nahi karayi, tumhare liye ghore aur oont nahi diye, aur tumhein chaudhry aur badshah nahi banaya? Wo kahega: Kyun nahi, ae mere Rab. Allah farmayega: Kya tum ne samjha tha ke tum mujh se milne wale ho? Wo kahega: Nahi. Farmayega: Main bhi tumhein bhool gaya jaise tum ne mujhe bhoolaya. Phir doosre ko bulaya jayega aur us se wahi kaha jayega; wo bhi wahi jawab dega; aur Allah farmayega: Main bhi tumhein bhool gaya jaise tum ne mujhe bhoolaya. Phir teesre ko bulaya jayega aur us se wahi kaha jayega; wo kahega: Ae mere Rab, main tujh par, teri kitab par aur tere rasoolon par iman laya, namaz padhi, roze rakhe, sadqa diya, aur apni taqat bhar achhi baatein ginayega. Allah farmayega: To yahan aao. Phir kaha jayega: Ab hum tum par gawah bhejte hain. Aur wo apne dil mein sochega: Kaun hai jo mere khilaf gawahi dega? Us ke munh par mohar lagai jayegi aur us ki raan se kaha jayega: Bol; pas us ki raan, gosht aur haddiyan us ke amal ki gawahi dengi. Ye is liye ke us ke paas apne nafs ki taraf se koi uzr baqi na rahe; aur ye us munafiq ke liye hai jis par Allah ghazabnaak hua."
"7033","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kya tum poore chaand ki raat mein chaand ko dekhne mein jhagda karte ho jab us ke aage koi baadal na ho? Kya tum sooraj dekhne mein jhagda karte ho jab us ke aage baadal na ho? Pas tum use isi tarah dekhte ho. Allah qayamat ke din logon ko jama karega aur farmayega: Jo kisi cheez ki ibadat karta tha wo us ke peechhe chale. Pas jo sooraj ki ibadat karta tha sooraj ke peechhe jayega, jo chaand ki ibadat karta tha chaand ke peechhe, jo taghooton ki ibadat karta tha un ke peechhe; aur ye ummat baqi rahegi jis mein us ke munafiq honge. Phir Allah un ke paas aayega us soorat ke siwa jo wo pehchante hain aur farmayega: Main tumhara Rab hun. Wo kahenge: Hum Allah ki panah maangte hain tujh se; ye hamari jagah hai yahan tak ke hamara Rab aaye; pas jab hamara Rab aayega hum use pehchan lenge. Phir Allah un ke paas us soorat mein aayega jo wo pehchante hain aur farmayega: Main tumhara Rab hun. Wo kahenge: Tu hi hamara Rab hai. Pas wo us ki pairwi karenge. Aur jahannam ke darmiyan pul lagaya jayega; main rasoolon mein sab se pehle apni ummat ke saath us se guzarunga; us din rasoolon ke siwa koi baat nahi karega, aur rasoolon ki baat us din ye hogi: Ae Allah, salaamat de, salaamat de. Aur jahannam mein Saadan ke kaanton jaisi baanki hongi, magar un ka andaza Allah ke siwa koi nahi janta; wo logon ko un ke amal ke mutabiq pakdengi. Pas un mein se koi apne amal se tabah hoga, koi zakhmi ho kar chhut jayega, phir najaat pa jayega, yahan tak ke jab Allah bandon ke darmiyan faisla kar chukega aur apni rehmat se jahannam walon mein se jise chahega nikaalna chahega, to farishton ko hukum dega ke aag se un logon ko nikaal do jo Allah ke saath kisi ko sharik nahi thehrate the aur La ilaha illallah kahte the. Wo unhein nikaalenge aur sajde ke nishanon se pehchanenge; aur Allah ne aag par haram kar diya hai ke wo sajde ke nishan khaye. Wo aag se nikalenge is haalat mein ke jal chuke honge; phir un par Nehar-e-Hayat ka pani daala jayega aur wo aise ugte hain jaise sail ke kachre mein daana ugta hai. Phir Allah bandon ke darmiyan faisla kar chukega aur ek aadmi jannat aur jahannam ke darmiyan baqi rahega; wo jahannam walon mein sab se aakhir mein jannat mein dakhil hone wala hoga, apna chehra aag ki taraf kiye hue. Wo kahega: Ae mere Rab, mera chehra aag se pher de, kyunke us ki badbu ne mujhe sataya aur us ki tezi ne mujhe jala diya. Allah farmayega: Kya agar main ye kar dun to tum is ke siwa kuch aur maangoge? Wo kahega: Nahi, teri izzat ki qasam. Pas wo Allah ko jitna chahe ahad aur pukhta wada de dega, aur Allah uska chehra aag se pher dega. Phir jab wo jannat ki taraf mutawajjeh hoga aur us ki raunak dekhega, to Allah jitni der chahega wo khamosh rahega, phir kahega: Ae mere Rab, mujhe jannat ke darwaze tak pahuncha de. Allah farmayega: Kya tum ne ahad aur pukhta wada nahi diya tha ke jo tum ne maanga us ke siwa kuch aur nahi maangoge? Wo kahega: Ae mere Rab, mujhe apni makhlooq mein sab se badnaseeb na banao. Allah farmayega: Agar main tumhein ye de dun to kya tum is ke siwa kuch aur nahi maangoge? Wo kahega: Nahi, teri izzat ki qasam, main is ke siwa kuch nahi maangunga. Pas wo apne Rab ko jitna chahe ahad aur wada de dega aur Allah use jannat ke darwaze tak pahuncha dega. Jab wo us ke darwaze par pahunchega aur us ki bahar aur us mein jo tazgi aur khushi hai dekhega, to Allah jitni der chahega wo khamosh rahega. Phir kahega: Ae mere Rab, mujhe jannat mein dakhil kar de. Allah farmayega: Ae ibne Adam, tera kya haal hai! Tu kitna bewafa hai! Kya tum ne ahad aur pukhta wada nahi diya tha ke jo diya gaya us ke siwa kuch aur nahi maangoge? Wo kahega: Ae mere Rab, mujhe apni makhlooq mein sab se badnaseeb na banao. Pas Allah us par hansega aur use jannat mein dakhil hone ki ijazat de dega. Allah farmayega: Tamanna kar; pas wo tamanna karega yahan tak ke us ki tamanna khatm ho jayegi; Allah farmayega: Is se ye zyada maang, is se ye zyada. Us ka Rab use yaad dilata rahega yahan tak ke us ki tamannayein khatm ho jayengi; Allah azz wa jal farmayega: Tumhare liye wo hai aur us ke saath utna hi aur."
"7034","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kya tum sirf apne kamzoron ki dua aur ikhlas se madad paye jate ho?"
"7035","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kya tum sirf apne kamzoron ki wajah se madad aur rizq paye jate ho?"
"7036","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kya tum mein se kisi ne abhi mere saath Quran padha? Main kehta hun: Mujhe kya hua ke Quran mein jhagda kiya ja raha hai?!"
"7037","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kya tum mein koi aisa aadmi hai jo apni biwi ke paas jaye, apna darwaza band kare, apna parda daal de aur Allah ke parde mein chhup jaye? Unhon ne kaha: Haan. Aap ne farmaya: Phir wo baith kar kahe: Maine aisa kiya, maine aisa kiya? Wo khamosh rahe, phir aurton ki taraf mutawajjeh ho kar farmaya: Kya tum mein koi aisi hai jo bayan karti hai? Wo bhi khamosh rahin; phir ek naujawan aurat apne ek ghutne par uth kar khadi hui aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko dekhne aur sunane ke liye lambi hui aur kaha: Ae Allah ke Rasool, wo mard bayan karte hain aur aurten bhi bayan karti hain. Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum jante ho us ki misal kya hai? Us ki misal shaitani aurat ki tarah hai jo raaste mein shaitan se mile aur wo apni hajat poori kare aur log dekhte rahein! Sun lo, mardon ki khushbu wo hai jis ki mehak zahir ho aur rang na ho; sun lo, aurton ki khushbu wo hai jis ka rang zahir ho aur mehak na ho; sun lo, koi mard kisi mard ke saath apna raaz na kholay aur koi aurat kisi aurat ke saath apna raaz na kholay siwaye apni aulad ya walid ke."
"7038","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Meri ummat ki halakat Quraysh ke kuch naujawan larkon ke haathon hogi."
"7039","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Halak ho gaye wo log jo takalluf aur gehri baaton mein jane wale hain."
"7040","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kisra halak hua, phir us ke baad koi Kisra nahi hoga; Qaisar zaroor halak hoga, phir us ke baad koi Qaisar nahi hoga; aur tum donon ke khazane Allah ki raah mein baantoge."
"7041","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum ne us ki khaal utaar kar dabagh kyun nahi kiya aur us se faida nahi uthaya? Sirf us ka khana haram kiya gaya hai."
"7042","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Tum ne use kyun nahi chhoda taake wo tauba kare aur Allah us ki tauba qubool kar le? Yani Maaz ko."
"7043","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aao barkat wale khane par; yani sehri."
"7044","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Aao aise jihad par jis mein koi kaanta nahi: Hajj."
"7045","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ye duniya mein mere do phool hain; yani Hasan aur Husain."
"7046","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qasam-e-Kaaba, ye hi zyada khasara uthane wale hain, qasam-e-Kaaba, ye hi qayamat ke din zyada khasara uthane wale hain, yani zyada maal jama karne wale, siwaye us ke jo Allah ke bandon mein aise aur aise kharch kare, aur aise log bahut kam hain. Us zaat ki qasam jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai, koi aadmi aisa nahi jo bakriyan, oont ya gaayen chhod kar mare aur un ki zakaat ada na ki ho, magar qayamat ke din wo us ke paas sab se bada aur mota ho kar aayegi, yahan tak ke wo apne sumon se use raundegi aur seenghon se maaregi, yahan tak ke logon ke darmiyan faisla ho jayega; jab bhi un ka aakhri hissa guzar jayega to pehla hissa dobara laut aayega."
"7047","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Ye Shaitan ka bande ki namaz se chheen lena hai; yani idhar udhar dekhna."
"7048","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Us ka pani paak hai aur us ka murda halal hai."
"7049","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo pura azad hai, Allah ka koi sharik nahi."
"7050","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo us par sadqa hai aur wo humare liye us ki taraf se tohfa hai."
"7051","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Wo aag ke halke hisse mein hai; aur agar main na hota to wo aag ke sab se neeche darje mein hota; yani Abu Talib."
"7052","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Apne aap par narmi rakho, main badshah nahi hun; main Quraysh ki ek aurat ka beta hun jo sookha gosht khati thi."
"7053","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Hijrat do qism ki hai: shehri ki hijrat aur badawi ki hijrat; badawi jab bulaya jaye to aata hai aur hukum diya jaye to itaat karta hai; aur shehri ki hijrat museebat mein sab se bada aur ajr mein sab se bada hai."
"7054","[AI-translation] Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Imam ko tohfa dena ghulul hai."
